<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-036" chapter-id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling" source-id="s-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling-ws1530928">
  <p id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">始興王<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p001:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_B">叔陵</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p001:m0006" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_B">子嵩</persName>，高宗之第二子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">十一年，丁所生母<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p002:m0008" ref="ryf_ghj_ryp">彭氏</persName>憂去職。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0000" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_B">叔陵</persName>以剉藥刀斫<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0007" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>中項。<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0012" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAA">太后</persName>馳來救焉，<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0019" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_B">叔陵</persName>又斫<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0023" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAA">太后</persName>數下。<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0028" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>乳媼<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0032" ref="sfs_3hb_c13">吳氏</persName>，時在<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0037" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAAA">太后</persName>側，自後掣其肘，<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0047" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>因得起。<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0053" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_B">叔陵</persName>仍持<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0057" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>衣，<persName id="c-chenshu-036-liujingyan-shuling:p003:m0061" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_A">後主</persName>自奮得免。</p>
</text>
